OL,5,
OL,6,CG2022FBBC London News is broadcast
OL,7,Ffrom Studio B, BBC Broadcasting House
OL,8,F(London), for the first time on a
OL,9,Fregular basis.
OL,10,
OL,11,FThis edition of the programme is
OL,12,Fpresented by Victoria Hollins.
OL,13,
